yphicon-log-in\"></span> Information for Participants</strong></div></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"well well-sm\"><strong>Wed 25 Jun 2025 16:00 - 17:30 at <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/room/issta-2025/issta-2025-venue-aurora-c\" class=\"room-link navigate\">Aurora C</a></strong> - <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/track/issta-2025/issta-2025-papers#program\" class=\"navigate\">Formal Analysis and Symbolic Execution</a> <small>Chair(s): <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/issta-2025/nameng\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\">Na Meng</a></small><div class=\"text-muted\">Info for room <strong>Aurora C</strong>: </div><blockquote class=\"info-participants\"><p>Aurora C is the third room in the Aurora wing.</p>\n<p>When facing the main Cosmos Hall, access to the Aurora wing is on the right, close to the side entrance of the hotel.</p>\n</blockquote></div></div></div></div><div class=\"modal-footer\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/details/issta-2025/issta-2025-papers/14/Model-Checking-Guided-Incremental-Testing-for-Distributed-Systems\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default navigate\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-new-window\"></span> All Details</a></span><a href=\"#\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"btn btn-default\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span> Close</a></div></div></div></div>"},{ "action": "runscript", "value": "$('#modal-cee7b8dd-3a83-464f-835d-21bc89f9a4b4').modal({ backdrop: 'static', keyboard: true}, 'show');" },
